accTitle: "NutsNews Free-Tier Guardrails"
accDescr: "Issue #116 adds a dedicated admin dashboard at `/admin/guardrails` for cost forecasting and free-tier risk monitoring."
flowchart TD
  METRICS["Usage and billing metrics"] --> NORMALIZE["Normalize per service limits"]
  NORMALIZE --> GUARDRAILS["Compare against warning/danger thresholds"]
  GUARDRAILS --> ALERT["Publish /admin/guardrails state"]
  ALERT --> DECISION{"Needs action?"}
  DECISION -->|No| CONTINUE["Continue with reduced-risk defaults"]
  DECISION -->|Yes| MITIGATE["Reduce load, throttle feature, or hold releases"]
  MITIGATE --> VERIFY["Recheck guardrail dashboard"]

